<TextPage title="Corrections" description="How factual, scoring, and attribution errors are fixed and logged.">
  <h2>What qualifies</h2><p>Wrong model IDs, prices, dates, policy claims, test classifications, source attributions, or scoring calculations are corrections. A vendor disagreement with a documented result is not automatically an error.</p>
  <h2>Process</h2><ol><li>Preserve the reported evidence.</li><li>Reproduce the issue.</li><li>Correct the source data or code.</li><li>Rerun affected tests and pages.</li><li>Add a visible correction note when the conclusion changed.</li></ol>
</TextPage>
